{{Item|Dragon Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in {{Zone|the end}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Dragon Essence}} can be be obtained in {{Zone|the end}} and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* Sacrificing specific items to the [[Draconic Altar]].
* [[Salvaging#Dragon|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Dragon Essence}}.
* Trading with {{NPCSprite|Tyzzo}} visitor in {{Zone|The Garden}}.
* Killing certain mobs:
